      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay I found a fix to this in the 'Just Dance' Vrchat world. You have to go to this website: https://yt-dl.org/ then click the 'youtube-dl.exe' to download it. Then you have to go to the drive where you have VRchat installed follow through here: D:\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat\\VRChat_Data\\StreamingAssets\nand then you just have to replace the 'youtube-dl.exe' with the one you just downloaded.\nHope this helped!",
